ont-size: 14px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">伊利亚王国的第一王子与实际掌权者，阴郁冷峻不怒自威的统治者。 </span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">迪塔利奥继承了父亲法里斯王的阴郁和容貌，因为比两个弟妹年长不少而有疏离感。迪塔利奥不会轻易表露自己的情绪，行事不在乎他人的评价。他一手组建了倒吊人组织，在法里斯王隐退之后，依靠自己的强硬手腕维持着伊利亚的稳定。 &#160;</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">迪塔利奥坚信，为了伊利亚的未来，没有什么不能被牺牲的，他愿意为此背负一切。</span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息107.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9b/936gcqp1t20fs9oc7zf5jjvhtr0mkkw.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" />\n</p>\n<center><small>*图片内容仅供参考，实际效果以游戏内为准</small></center>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息104.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4e/mqwclur2a71tay6w1t7e7sz1zexygzs.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021190352\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 